    "text": "Frosty start to the week! \ud83e\uddca\ud83e\udde4\n\nIt\u2019s a cold start, especially for those who had clear skies last night. Mount Cook plummeted to -8\u00b0C, Tekapo to -5\u00b0C and Queenstown -4\u00b0C overnight. \ud83e\udd76\n\nHighs of 12\u00b0C forecast for Auckland, Christchurch and Dunedin today but only 9\u00b0C for Wellington. \ud83c\udf21\ufe0f\n\nmetservice.com",
